This directory contains public domain / CC0 cryptographic implementations:

1. TweetNaCl (Ed25519 digital signatures and SHA-512)
   Authors: Daniel J. Bernstein, Bernard van Gastel, Wesley Janssen, Tanja Lange, Peter Schwabe, Sjaak Smetsers
   License: Public Domain / CC0-1.0
   Reference: https://tweetnacl.cr.yp.to/

2. SHA-256 (FIPS 180-2 implementation)
   Author: Brad Conte (brad AT bradconte.com)
   License: Public Domain / CC0-1.0
   Reference: https://github.com/B-Con/crypto-algorithms

3. C++ wrappers (crypto_utils)
   License: AGPL-3.0-or-later (aligned with Kick host)
